  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rab 307.02 “Assignment” means one or more real estate appraisals and resulting written appraisal reports that are the subject of a single contract to provide an appraisal.\n\nSource. #7648, eff 2-20-02; ss by #9018, eff 11-1-07; ss by #10270, eff 2-2-13, EXPIRED: 2-2-23\n\nNew. #13967, eff 7-16-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rab 300)",
